:: Prologue_Radio {"position":"200,400","size":"100,100"}
<div class="vn-container">
    <<script>>
        /* Memutar audio radio secara otomatis saat layar dimuat */
        setup.sound.play("police_radio", "audio/sfx/police_radio.mp3", false, 0.9);
    <</script>>

    <div class="vn-dialogue-box" style="justify-content: center; align-items: center; max-height: 100vh !important; padding: 20px;">
        
        <!-- NARRATIVE INTRO -->
        <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 20px auto; font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace; color: #ccc; text-align: center;">
            <<if $job == "Police Officer">>
                You pull your emergency-band scanner from your gear bag. Your hands are shaking slightly as you dial into the encrypted precinct frequency.
            <<else>>
                You boot up your rig, your fingers flying across the mechanical keyboard. You bypass the local scramblers, hunting for raw, unencrypted police chatter.
            <</if>>
            The speaker hisses with white noise before a voice breaks through.
        </div>

        <!-- ========================================== -->
        <!-- RADIO UI CONTAINER                         -->
        <!-- ========================================== -->
        <div style="width: 100%; max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto; background: #050505; border: 2px solid #333; border-top: 4px solid var(--accent-gold); border-radius: 4px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.9); overflow: hidden; position: relative;">
            
            <!-- FREQUENCY DISPLAY -->
            <div style="background: #111; padding: 10px 15px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.9em; color: var(--accent-gold); border-bottom: 1px solid #222;">
                <span class="glitch">FREQ: 154.790 MHz</span>
                <span style="animation: cursor-blink 1s infinite;">● REC</span>
            </div>

            <!-- AUDIO TRANSCRIPT -->
            <div style="padding: 20px; font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace; font-size: 0.85em; line-height: 1.5; color: #a3c2c2;">
                
                <span style="color: #666;">[STATIC HISS]</span><br><br>

                <b style="color: #fff;">UNIT 4-CHARLIE:</b><br>
                <i>"Dispatch, 4-Charlie! We've lost the 5th Street barricade! They are not stopping! I repeat, shooting them in the chest does nothing! They just keep coming!"</i><br><br>

                <span style="color: #666;">[HEAVY THUD / STRUGGLE]</span><br><br>

                <b style="color: #fff;">UNIT 4-CHARLIE:</b><br>
                <i>"God damn it, get off the damn car! Dispatch, standard protocol is useless! Requesting authorization for unrestricted lethal force!"</i><br><br>

                <span style="color: #666;">[RADIO SQUELCH]</span><br><br>

                <b style="color: #fff;">DISPATCH (CALM):</b><br>
                <i>"4-Charlie, unrestricted lethal force is authorized. All units, listen carefully. Standard rules of engagement are suspended. Body shots will not stop them. You must destroy the brain. Aim for the head. I repeat... aim for the head. Avoid all physical contact."</i><br><br>

                <span style="color: #666;">[SIGNAL CUTS OUT]</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ========================================== -->
        <!-- NARRATIVE OUTRO & ACTIONS                  -->
        <!-- ========================================== -->
        <br><br>
        <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace; color: #ccc; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <<if $job == "Police Officer">>
                <b style="color:var(--accent-red);">'Standard rules of engagement are suspended.'</b> Total lethal force. No warnings, no arrests, no hesitation. They only issue that for active warzones. You stare at the radio. Whatever is out there, the law is officially dead.
            <<else>>
                <b style="color:var(--accent-red);">'You must destroy the brain.'</b> You stare at the blinking green light of your monitor. The police aren't trying to control a riot. They are executing people in the streets. 
            <</if>>
        </div>

        <div class="choice-menu" style="max-width: 400px; margin: 0 auto;">
            <button>
                <<link "Kill the radio and step back">>
                    
                    /* Add information to the Lore Database upon leaving */
                    <<run window.addLore("Radio Intercept (Day 0)", "Police dispatch authorized unrestricted lethal force. Standard body shots are ineffective against the infected. Neutralization requires destroying the brain. All physical contact must be avoided.")>>
                    
                    <<goto "Prologue">>
                <</link>>
                <span class="btn-sub">Add tactical intel to your PDA.</span>
            </button>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>